My Node.js API is responding slowly under load. Here's the main handler:

```javascript
app.get('/api/users', async (req, res) => {
  const users = await db.collection('users').find({}).toArray();
  const enrichedUsers = [];
  for (const user of users) {
    const profile = await db.collection('profiles').findOne({ userId: user._id });
    const posts = await db.collection('posts').find({ userId: user._id }).toArray();
    enrichedUsers.push({ ...user, profile, posts });
  }
  res.json(enrichedUsers);
});
```

